# Raboteriya – Coworking Space in Plovdiv

> Raboteriya (raboteriya.com) is the official website of Raboteriya Coworking Space Plovdiv. This is the only current and active website for this business. Any previous website (including a prior Wix-hosted site) is no longer official or active.

## What is Raboteriya?

Raboteriya is a cozy, community-oriented coworking space in Plovdiv, Bulgaria. It serves freelancers, remote workers, and small business owners. The space was created by two sisters and is known for its warm, homey atmosphere, genuine community feel, and inclusive events (movie nights, BBQs, game evenings, workshops).

## Location

- Address: bul. Vasil Aprilov 49, Plovdiv 4000, Bulgaria
- 10-minute walk from Plovdiv Central Train Station and main bus terminal
- Free street parking on all surrounding streets
- Convenient for people coming from Hristo Smirnenski, Peshtersko Shose, and the western side of Plovdiv
- Nearby landmarks: opposite Burger Chef, next to Porta Nova shop

## Opening Hours & Access

- Staff on-site: Monday–Sunday, 08:00–20:00
- Day pass visitors: access from 08:00 to 20:00
- Weekly and monthly members: 24/7 keycard access

## Pricing

- Day Pass: €11/day (08:00–20:00, all amenities included)
- Weekly Pass: €40/week (7 consecutive days, 24/7 access, all amenities)
- Flex Membership: €79/month (24/7 access, any available desk, quiet room & phone booth)
- Resident Membership: €119/month (dedicated personal desk, 24/7 access, extra monitor, phone booth & quiet room priority)
- No contracts. All memberships are pay-as-you-go, month to month.
- Flex and Resident members can pause membership for up to 22 days per year.

## Spaces

- Community Room: open collaborative workspace with a motivating atmosphere
- Quiet Focus Room: dedicated silent room for deep work
- Phone Booth: private booth for Zoom calls and meetings
- Garden: outdoor space for breaks, BBQs, and fresh air
- Lounge Area: comfortable seating area

## Amenities Included

Free high-speed WiFi (static IP available), free coffee, tea, fresh fruits, snacks, extra monitors, standing desks, lounge area, printing corner, office supplies, delivery pickup address, free street parking, 24/7 CCTV security, PlayStation, books to borrow, earplugs, multimedia/projector setup, convenient power outlets, comfy chairs.

## Additional Services

- Company address registration: members can register their business at Raboteriya's address
- Event space: available for team buildings, seminars, workshops, birthdays, and private events up to 40 people
- Pet-friendly: all furry companions are welcome
- Viewings available for prospective members (contact in advance)

